^{:go/end 72} (go/func RegForSRT "RegForSRT is the register a data abort's SRT names: X0..X30 (31, XZR,\nreads as zero and has no Reg; it is reported as RegX0's absence by ok).\n" [^uint32 srt] :results [Reg bool] (return (conv Reg srt) (< srt 31)))
